Description: Power panel: choose how automatic brightness works
 Adds a "Brightness Adjustment" row under Automatic Screen Brightness:
 "Around the Slider" or "Follow Room Light" (gnome-settings-daemon key
 ambient-mode, from the sb4edge gnome-settings-daemon patch). The row only
 appears when the installed gnome-settings-daemon has that key.
Author: SB4-Edge-Linux
Forwarded: not-needed
---
--- a/panels/power/cc-power-panel.blp	2026-11-16 10:15:35
+++ b/panels/power/cc-power-panel.blp	2026-11-16 10:16:12
@@ -184,6 +184,17 @@
                 notify::visible => $power_saving_group_visibility_cb(template);
               }
 
+              Adw.ComboRow als_mode_row {
+                visible: false;
+                title: _("Brightness Adjustment");
+                model: StringList {
+                  strings [
+                    _("Around the Slider"),
+                    _("Follow Room Light"),
+                  ]
+                };
+              }
+
               Adw.SwitchRow dim_screen_row {
                 title: _("_Dim Screen");
                 subtitle: _("Reduce screen brightness when the device is inactive");
--- a/panels/power/cc-power-panel.c	2026-11-16 10:15:35
